      "cooked": "<p>That's great! Thanks for sharing this. I have been thinking about options for doing something like this myself, so seeing this helps.  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/grin.png?v=9\" title=\":grin:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":grin:\"></p>\n<p>Did you glue the lids to the bases? Or are they just sitting on the bases?</p>\n<p>Greatly appreciated it, and great idea!</p>",
