      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/bb73d2/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-09-13T23:13:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Rabit\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/48/5774_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Rabit:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Did you glue the lids to the bases? Or are they just sitting on the bases?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>They're just sitting there. The boxes are tight enough on their own that I'm not worried about the tops ever falling off. Theoretically, I could store stuff in them, but I haven't tested that yet.</p>",
