      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-09-16T13:30:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Started working on this, myself. Something to consider: I cut holes in the backs to better allow the hangers to fit behind the boxes and allow them to be flush with the wall.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/5/584e82342c7d2aac33a74ed00d98dc4f0a10fe48.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/584e82342c7d2aac33a74ed00d98dc4f0a10fe48\" title=\"\"><img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/584e82342c7d2aac33a74ed00d98dc4f0a10fe48_2_626x499.jpeg\" alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"cBcdIKcT0IIYXYQKca3Mssmh5k4\" width=\"626\" height=\"499\" srcset=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/584e82342c7d2aac33a74ed00d98dc4f0a10fe48_2_626x499.jpeg, //forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/5/584e82342c7d2aac33a74ed00d98dc4f0a10fe48.jpeg 1.5x, //forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/5/584e82342c7d2aac33a74ed00d98dc4f0a10fe48.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/584e82342c7d2aac33a74ed00d98dc4f0a10fe48_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\"></span><span class=\"informations\">665×531 179 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>(Because my original box was a little dinged up from use, I took a Sharpie to the edges of the front. Can't really notice from a distance unless you're looking for it.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/sunglasses.png?v=9\" title=\":sunglasses:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sunglasses:\"> )</p>\n<p>Thanks, again, for the original idea, Greonhal!</p>",
